# The sync server both phones talk to — the Cloudflare Worker you deploy from
# worker/ (see worker/README.md). Uncomment the line below and paste your
# Worker's URL; the deployed site then pre-fills it, so neither phone has to
# type it in.
#
# This URL is not a secret — it is baked into the built JavaScript, and it is
# the family code, not the address, that protects the log. Leave it commented
# out to keep the app device-local, or to enter the URL by hand on each phone.

# VITE_SYNC_URL=https://baby-log-sync.yourname.workers.dev
